---
// src/components/landing/HowItWorks.astro
---

<section class="relative mb-64 mt-32">
  <div class="text-center mb-24 relative z-10">
    <span
      class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.5em] text-primary bg-surface-container-highest px-4 py-2 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(186,158,255,0.1)] uppercase"
    >
      HOW_IT_WORKS
    </span>
    <h2
      class="font-headline text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem)] font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] uppercase mt-12 text-on-surface"
    >
      The <span class="text-primary text-glow">Workflow</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xl leading-relaxed font-light mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      TajsOS bridges the gap between chaotic thought and linear execution.
      Here is how the system organizes your digital life.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-12 rounded-3xl instrument-glow flex flex-col gap-6 relative group overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-primary/30 border border-transparent">
      <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 text-[10rem] font-headline font-bold text-surface-container-highest opacity-50 group-hover:text-primary/10 transition-colors pointer-events-none">1</div>
      <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center text-primary shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(186,158,255,0.15)] z-10">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">inbox</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface z-10">Capture</h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-light z-10">
        Drop everything into the Inbox. Thoughts, tasks, or links. Fast intake without forced categorization interrupts context switching.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-12 rounded-3xl instrument-glow flex flex-col gap-6 relative group overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-secondary/30 border border-transparent md:translate-y-12">
      <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 text-[10rem] font-headline font-bold text-surface-container-highest opacity-50 group-hover:text-secondary/10 transition-colors pointer-events-none">2</div>
      <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(192,140,247,0.15)] z-10">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">account_tree</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface z-10">Triage</h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-light z-10">
        Transform chaotic inputs into actionable Nodes. Link them to Projects or Areas, assigning tags and metadata to build your web of knowledge.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-12 rounded-3xl instrument-glow flex flex-col gap-6 relative group overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-tertiary/30 border border-transparent md:translate-y-24">
      <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 text-[10rem] font-headline font-bold text-surface-container-highest opacity-50 group-hover:text-tertiary/10 transition-colors pointer-events-none">3</div>
      <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,151,181,0.15)] z-10">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">task_alt</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface z-10">Execute</h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-light z-10">
        Engage Focus Mode to work on prioritized tasks. The system clears away noise, tracking your execution time and maintaining historical logs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
